<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; }
        .header { background-color: #0044cc; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; }
        .footer { background-color: #f0f0f0; padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }
        .amount { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #00aa00; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Weekly Commission Summary</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
        <p>Great news! Here is your commission summary for the last week:</p>
        <p>Total Earned: <span class="amount">KES {{amount}}</span></p>
        <p>New Referrals: {{referralCount}}</p>
        <p>Keep growing your network to earn more!</p>
        <a href="https://driver.cabi.app/commissions">View Details</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        &copy; 2025 Cabi Inc.
    </div>
</body>
</html>
